Third-party data redistributed in this repository

penkin/data/iAL1006.xml
    Genome-scale metabolic model of Penicillium chrysogenum from Agren et al.
    (2013), PLoS Computational Biology 9:e1002980, distributed with the RAVEN
    toolbox. Redistributed here unmodified for reproducibility.

penkin/data/GSE9825_series_matrix_txt.gz, penkin/data/geo_raw/
    Microarray data from NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus series GSE9825 and
    GSE12632. GEO data are in the public domain. Redistributed unmodified so
    that the analysis runs without network access.

penkin/data/*_digitized.csv, penkin/data/*_exact_*.csv, penkin/data/*_summary.csv
    Numerical values transcribed or digitized from published figures and
    tables, as documented in penkin/data/validation_source_provenance.csv.
    Each file records its primary source. These are small factual extracts
    used for quantitative comparison and are not reproductions of the
    published articles.
